        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana RCA430, Solid Brass Heavy Duty Roller Catch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe tension on the roller can be adjusted with the 2 adjustment screws on the mounting plate face with out removing the assembly from the door. Roller catches are installed in the top, bottom or side edge of doors to hold them in a closed position. Packaged with matching finish mounting screws, full lip strike plate and available in 10 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-RCA430-size.gif?v=1704354777\" width=\"600\" height=\"139\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana RCA430 Heavy Duty Door Roller Catch Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-adjustable-roller-catch-deltana-rca336\"><b>Light Duty Roller Catch</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nSpecifications</b> for the Deltana RCA430 Heavy Duty Door Roller Catch:\r\n<ul> \r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 3-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Easy to adjust tension.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/RCA430.pdf?v=1691095374\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana RCA430 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
