                "title": "Heavy Duty Brass Roller Catch",
                "description": "Deltana RCA430 Solid Brass Adjustable Heavy Duty Door Roller Catch - The tension on the roller can be adjusted with the 2 adjustment screws. Roller catches are installed in the top, bottom or side edge of doors to hold them in a closed position. Packaged with matching finish mounting screws, full lip strike plate and available in 10 different finishes.",
